{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Sonki's Lagoon, a colorful low-poly 3D high speed platformer inspired by classic games of the genre!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Surf and dash through a vibrant world filled with secrets, friendly critters and unique challenges. Express yourself with stylish moves and collect all the Johnnies in this nostalgic indie aventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976150/extras/4b87e87aa2979cdf9df02daf569e15eb.avif?t=1774286112\" width=1414 height=464 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced 3D platforming with unique physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A funky low-poly world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and equipments to find and collect!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming characters and wacky humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own path in this indie open world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3976150?t=1774286112","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976150/4d7e2e5091b4e65d243e6ab0daf1fe435e3276ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774286112","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976150/68a97e99c7c12ad0b3bde323d58fbf2a240136a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774286112","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976150/68a97e99c7c12ad0b3bde323d58fbf2a240136a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774286112","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller